{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "reborn-marquee",
  "title": "跑马灯",
  "description": "用于横向或纵向无限循环滚动内容的跑马灯组件，支持悬停暂停与渐隐遮罩。",
  "category": "misc",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "magic-ui"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "any",
      "required": false,
      "description": "应用于根容器的自定义类名。",
      "default": "''"
    },
    {
      "name": "reverse",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "description": "反转滚动方向。",
      "default": "false"
    },
    {
      "name": "pauseOnHover",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "description": "鼠标悬停时暂停动画。",
      "default": "false"
    },
    {
      "name": "vertical",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "description": "orientation=\"vertical\"` 的兼容别名，传入后优先生效。",
      "default": "false"
    },
    {
      "name": "orientation",
      "type": "RebornMarqueeOrientation",
      "required": false,
      "description": "设置滚动方向。",
      "default": "'horizontal'"
    },
    {
      "name": "repeat",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "重复渲染插槽内容的次数。",
      "default": "4"
    },
    {
      "name": "overlay",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "description": "是否显示两端的渐隐遮罩。",
      "default": "true"
    },
    {
      "name": "ui",
      "type": "RebornMarqueeUI",
      "required": false,
      "description": "覆盖 `root`、`content`、`overlayStart`、`overlayEnd` 等插槽类名。",
      "default": "() => ({})"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [
    {
      "name": "default",
      "props": "",
      "description": ""
    }
  ],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/reborn-marquee/RebornMarqueeDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "品牌 Logo 墙、合作伙伴列表循环滚动。",
    "用户评价、卡片流的横向循环展示（pauseOnHover 悬停暂停）。",
    "需要纵向循环滚动条目（orientation=\"vertical\"）时。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "文字公告循环播报改用 reborn-notice-bar（双端可用）。",
    "分页式轮播图改用 reborn-carousel。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "repeat 默认 4，默认插槽内容会被重复渲染多次，勿在插槽内放带唯一 id 的元素。",
    "vertical 是 orientation=\"vertical\" 的兼容别名，传入后优先生效。",
    "overlay 默认 true，两端自带渐隐遮罩，可通过 ui 覆盖 overlayStart/overlayEnd。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add reborn-marquee"
  },
  "sourceRefs": {
